            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>According to an embodiment disclosed in the present document, a history-based motion vector prediction (HMVP) buffer for the current block can be derived on the basis of a history, and motion information of the current block can be derived on the basis of HMVP candidates included in the HMVP buffer, and thus inter prediction efficiency can be increased.</p>
            </abstract>
